  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'KEEP YOUR HEADLIGHTS ON. TRUST YOUR EYES, NOT EVERY SIGN.


    Follow
    the road, read the numbered exit clues and drive the correct route gates. The
    black semi is a physical pursuer: brake, turn and use junctions to avoid it.
    Repeated landmarks and contradictory signs are intentional. Complete the route
    before taking the last exit. Survival variants award actual time alive.


    Movement
    uses your assigned driving controls. ACTION braces a tipped cursed load using
    physical restoring torque; otherwise ACTION away from a station toggles headlights.
    Each human keeps an independent truck and camera. Cooperative variants share
    objectives and never award individual winner points. Eliminated participants
    spectate surviving trucks. Rematch restores the whole venue, cargo and encounters.
    Default match: four minutes.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
